Most brand campaigns ask a young audience to watch. Games for Brands asks them to play.

I started it because the best-performing activations I worked on had one thing in common: people had something to do. A mini-game on a website, a leaderboard on a stand, a challenge that runs for four weeks and gives people a reason to come back.

## What it makes

- Branded mini-games for websites and campaigns
- Multi-week challenges with leaderboards and prizes
- Game activations at events and in stores
- Online events built around play

Arabic and English from day one.
